{
  "seed": "bigville_household",
  "version": "1.3.0",
  "comment": "HOUSEHOLD LABOUR DIVISION: a household is a group with ONE shared food need and ONE shared store. When the store runs low the household wants food; ONE member volunteers to fetch it (the others don't duplicate), carries it home to the shared store, and everyone eats from it. Fixes the spouses-both-fetch collision -- labour divides.",
