    {
      "name": "hh_volunteer",
      "batch": false,
      "comment": "Household labour division -- ONE member VOLUNTEERS: an idle, alive member takes the household's fetch task on (will_do), but only if no household-mate already has it. So one member goes for the food and the others don't set out too -- the collision is gone. The member then executes it on the map (dx_*: go to the source, buy, carry it HOME) and delivers to the shared store. The fetcher is the household's PROVIDER (a fixed role, H provides_via member) if one is set -- so the SAME member does the errands, not alternating; otherwise it falls back to the most-rested member. Still only if no mate already has it.",
